# Git CLI

When running git in the terminal (status, pull, push, merge, commit):

- **Windows:** use `git` from PATH (e.g. `git status`, `git pull origin develop`).
- **macOS (Cursor agent shell):** prefer `/usr/bin/git` if PATH/git is unreliable (e.g. `/usr/bin/git status`).

This ensures git is found consistently across team machines and agent shells.
